silm:instances_papers_06_topology_jepa_chapters_05_vjepa_temporal_extension_sections_01_spatiotemporal_patch_category_concrete_anchor silm:hasExample "In '01SpatiotemporalPatchCategoryConcreteAnchor', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, the local olog hypothesis for the head patch: cat-classification node plus outgoing Cat morphism, signed by Dr. Osei in the May 2026 Tartu Animal Clinic record; also, the local olog hypothesis for the body patch: BodyMass:4.2kg quality node plus the typed measurement arrow from scale-witness WeightMeas to Mittens." .
